      "Host exposure, ISO and focus remain automatic. No claim of ISO 800 simulation.",
      "2026-09-30: visually reviewed nine owner samples from digital-harinezumi-again. Retain object texture by reducing Gaussian denoise and using restrained detail recovery. No paired scene fit; these are design hypotheses.",
      "Monochrome samples show intermediate grays in black bicycle frames and foliage. Open the shadow toe and soften upper-midtone rise while retaining black and clipped highlights."
